0731694","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770731694","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770731694","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Game contains low resolution pixel art blood & gore effect."},"demos":[{"appid":2093170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN THE COMMUNITY</h1><p><br>Join the Wizordum community on <strong></strong>and talk directly with devs and other fans around the world.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ancient Seal of Terrabruma has shattered, unleashing the forces of Chaos once more. As one of the last Mages of Wizordum sanctuary, you must embark on a quest to find the source of this corruption and push the Chaos back before they consume the kingdom in a speedrun-friendly fantasy FPS tearing a page from the spellbooks of \u201890s fantasy FPS classics like Hexen and Heretic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d6ff5346e4a52be12a4aa440ff7014b4.poster.avif?t=1770731694\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d6ff5346e4a52be12a4aa440ff7014b4.webm?t=1770731694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d6ff5346e4a52be12a4aa440ff7014b4.mp4?t=1770731694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p c