708e603c18f7a498ef9b9b6c1782.webm?t=1770731694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/6703708e603c18f7a498ef9b9b6c1782.mp4?t=1770731694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVEL EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and download custom adventures or full-fledged episodes with the in-game level editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d1b4cba3fe69ec691cd6e8457696d110.poster.avif?t=1770731694\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d1b4cba3fe69ec691cd6e8457696d110.webm?t=1770731694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/d1b4cba3fe69ec691cd6e8457696d110.mp4?t=1770731694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Emberheart Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/header.jpg?t=1770731694","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11.5<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1715590/1454046312/65bd8693bfcb1d5fd801f42db9fe8595d3745c1e/1758584602/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758616024","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1715590/1454046312/65bd8693bfcb1d5fd801f42db9fe8595d3745c1e/1758584602/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758616024","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https:/